<%- include('../partials/app-start') %>
<div class="mb-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><div><a class="text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-white" href="/dns">← Semua zone</a><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black"><%= zone.domain %></h2></div><form method="post" action="/dns/<%= zone.id %>/delete"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn-danger" data-confirm="Hapus zone dan semua record DNS ini?" type="submit">Hapus zone</button></form></div>
<section class="card p-5 sm:p-6"><h3 class="font-bold">Tambah record</h3><form method="post" action="/dns/<%= zone.id %>/records" class="mt-5 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-6"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div><label class="label">Name</label><input class="field" name="name" value="@" required><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Gunakan @ untuk apex, * untuk wildcard, _service._tcp untuk SRV.</p></div><div><label class="label">Type</label><select class="field" name="type"><% types.forEach(t => { %><option><%= t %></option><% }) %></select></div><div class="lg:col-span-2"><label class="label">Value</label><input class="field" name="value" placeholder="203.0.113.10 / target.example.com / SRV: weight port target" required></div><div><label class="label">TTL</label><input class="field" type="number" name="ttl" value="300" min="60" max="86400"></div><div><label class="label">Priority</label><input class="field" type="number" name="priority" placeholder="MX/SRV priority"></div><div class="lg:col-span-6"><button class="btn-primary" type="submit">Simpan & reload BIND9</button></div></form></section>
<section class="card mt-6 p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-3 lg:flex-row lg:items-start"><div><div class="metric-kicker">DNS-01 automation</div><h3 class="mt-1 font-bold">Wildcard SSL otomatis</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm text-slate-500">Terbitkan satu sertifikat untuk <code><%= zone.domain %></code> dan <code>*.<%= zone.domain %></code>. Credential disimpan root-only untuk Certbot renewal dan tidak pernah ditampilkan kembali.</p></div><span class="badge">Auto renew</span></div>
<form method="post" action="/dns/<%= zone.id %>/wildcard-ssl" class="mt-5 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div><label class="label">DNS provider</label><select class="field" name="provider" data-wildcard-provider><option value="local-bind">BIND9 lokal HostPanel (TSIG otomatis)</option><option value="cloudflare">Cloudflare DNS API</option><option value="rfc2136">RFC2136 / TSIG eksternal</option></select></div><div><label class="label">Propagation seconds</label><input class="field" name="propagation_seconds" type="number" min="10" max="600" value="30"></div><div class="lg:col-span-2" data-provider-cloudflare><label class="label">Cloudflare API Token</label><input class="field" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" name="api_token" placeholder="Token dengan DNS:Edit hanya untuk zone ini"><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">Gunakan API Token scoped; jangan Global API Key.</p></div><div data-provider-rfc2136><label class="label">RFC2136 server</label><input class="field" name="server" placeholder="ns1.example.com"></div><div data-provider-rfc2136><label class="label">Port</label><input class="field" name="port" type="number" value="53"></div><div data-provider-rfc2136><label class="label">TSIG key name</label><input class="field" name="key_name" placeholder="certbot-acme"></div><div data-provider-rfc2136><label class="label">Algorithm</label><select class="field" name="algorithm"><option>HMAC-SHA256</option><option>HMAC-SHA512</option></select></div><div class="lg:col-span-2" data-provider-rfc2136><label class="label">TSIG secret</label><input class="field" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" name="secret" placeholder="base64 secret"></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 rounded-xl border border-amber-400/20 bg-amber-400/[0.05] p-3 text-xs text-amber-100">BIND9 lokal hanya akan diberi <code>update-policy</code> untuk TXT <code>_acme-challenge.<%= zone.domain %></code>. Pastikan authoritative DNS benar-benar public pada UDP/TCP 53 sebelum memilih mode lokal.</div><div class="lg:col-span-2"><button class="btn-primary w-full" data-confirm="Terbitkan/perbarui wildcard certificate dan simpan credential DNS root-only untuk renewal?" type="submit">Pasang Wildcard SSL + Auto-Renew</button></div></form></section>
<section class="mt-6"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Value</th><th>TTL</th><th>Priority</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><% if (!records.length) { %><tr><td colspan="6" class="text-slate-500">Belum ada record tambahan. SOA dan NS default dibuat otomatis.</td></tr><% } %><% records.forEach(r => { %><tr><td class="font-mono text-xs"><%= r.name %></td><td><span class="badge"><%= r.type %></span></td><td class="max-w-md break-all font-mono text-xs"><%= r.value %></td><td><%= r.ttl %></td><td><%= r.priority ?? '-' %></td><td><form method="post" action="/dns/<%= zone.id %>/records/<%= r.id %>/delete"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn-danger" data-confirm="Hapus record ini?" type="submit">Hapus</button></form></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div></section>
<%- include('../partials/app-end') %>
